{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國防情報局（DIA）近日公佈了一張迄今最清晰的中國神秘空天飛機照片，使這款長期籠罩在保密氛圍中的航天器首次以較為完整的形象出現在公眾視野中。該照片由商業遙感衞星於2024年5月28日拍攝，當時衞星距離目標不足90公裏。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584424.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:04:51.716410+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.444239+00:00","content_hash":"70174318ed3f5bd4e407bef8692a0b9344d7d43694aaba88eb3f93f92c2a5fd9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}